{
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_019_01": "A skill that increases the speed\r\nat which magic recovers when\r\nusing Hug Mode in battle.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_103_02": "Cheshire recovers his vitality\r\nwhen reverting to Hug Mode.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_115_01": "A skill that enables Cheshire to \r\nperform a pounce attack after \r\nholding and releasing [BTN:R2 ] \r\nin Unleashed Mode.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_021_01": "A skill where Cheshire can deflect\r\nprojectiles when being extended\r\nin Hug Mode with [BTN:RS ].",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_204_01": "In the archive section of the menu,\r\nyou can read more about the\r\ncharacters, enemies, and more you \r\nhave met along your journey.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_DIALOG_TXT_01": "Try out skills you've learned here.\r\nGo to the practice room?",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_212_02": "In order to learn new skills,\r\nCereza requires Onyx Roses,\r\nand Cheshire requires Avalon Drops.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_104_01": "Cheshire's attacks in his elemental\r\nforms are significantly more powerful\r\nthan his attacks in his regular form.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_112_02": "Unbound Cheshire dodges with [BTN:L1 ]\r\nand can perform a devastating\r\nattack with [BTN:R1 ].",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_249_01": "When selecting a Sanctuary \r\nto move to using Ignis' Pathways,\r\nIgnis will recommend the Sanctuary \r\nclosest to Cereza's next objective.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_008_01": "Items have all different kinds of\r\nuseful effects. Use an item by\r\npressing and holding the \r\ncorresponding direction on [BTN:DP ].",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_215_01": "Cereza carrying Cheshire in his\r\nstuffed toy form is called Hug Mode.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_211_01": "In the Preparations menu, \r\nCereza and Cheshire can change \r\ntheir costumes. Costumes are acquired\r\nby meeting certain conditions.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_207_02": "Approach a Sanctuary to unlock it,\r\nadding it to your map. Always\r\nremember to unlock any\r\nSanctuaries you may pass by.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_327": "While holding [BTN:L2 ], rotate [BTN:LS ]\r\nto restore objects to their \r\noriginal condition.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_229_01": "Some wisps will follow behind\r\nCereza after being helped.\r\nBe careful, if they take any damage\r\nthey will be defeated instantly.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_423": "Perform a special Fire Elemental\r\nattack at the end of a Bind Combo\r\nwhen using Fire Cheshire.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_129_01": "A skill where Cheshire can\r\npull Cereza while extended \r\nin Hug Mode with [BTN:RS ]\r\nso the two move faster.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_427": "Cheshire's attacks deal even more\r\ndamage to enemies.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_216_02": "In Unleashed Mode, move Cereza\r\nwith [BTN:LS ] and Cheshire with [BTN:RS ].",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_025_01": "For this Witch Pulse, tilt and hold \r\n[BTN:LS ] while the marker travels\r\nacross the stretched red line.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_330": "Hold many more items.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_323": "Hold even more items.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_111_01": "Being a demon, Cheshire is \r\nunable to pass through areas\r\nwith rosemary. You will need to\r\nfind another route for Cheshire.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_107_02": "Grab something with Cheshire's vine \r\ntongue and then press and hold \r\n[BTN:R1 ] to pull it towards him.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_238_01": "Unicorn Horns are a\r\nconcocting compound purified\r\nin bright red crystal. They \r\ncan be used for concoctions.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_207_01": "The red arches found throughout\r\nthe forest symbolise Sanctuaries,\r\nkey locations for finding your\r\nway through Avalon.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_022_01": "A skill that creates a shockwave\r\nstunning nearby enemies when picking\r\nup Cheshire in his stuffed toy form.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_324": "Deflect enemy projectiles when\r\nextending Cheshire with [BTN:RS ].",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_420": "Cereza rides Cheshire, \r\nusing her magic to stabilise\r\nhis unbound demonic power.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_116_01": "A skill that lets Cheshire\r\nunleash a Charge Strike near \r\na weakened enemy to finish \r\nthem off by holding and releasing [BTN:R2 ]. ",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_424": "In Hug Mode, press [BTN:R2 ] \r\nto have Cheshire jab the enemy, \r\ndistracting them briefly.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_216_01": "Summoning Cheshire and moving\r\nthe two independently is called\r\nUnleashed Mode.",
  "MENU_POSEMENU_DIALOG_TXT_03": "Any unsaved progress will be lost.\r\nProceed to the title screen?",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_107_01": "Press [BTN:Y] to transform \r\nto Wood Cheshire. In this form,\r\nCheshire can extend his vine\r\ntongue with [BTN:R1 ].",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_999_01": "???",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_320": "Further the speed at which the\r\nSpell Cooldown gauge recovers.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_109_03": "Water Cheshire can also swim. \r\nSwitch back to any other form in \r\nwater and he will automatically\r\nswitch back to his water form.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_328": "Press [BTN:L1 ] in Hug Mode \r\nto make Cereza channel magical \r\nenergy into Cheshire, filling his \r\nmagic gauge in an instant.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_103_01": "Cheshire has his own vitality,\r\nand will return to his stuffed\r\ntoy form when his vitality runs out.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_212_01": "Check mirrors nearby lanterns\r\nwith [BTN:L1 ] to teach Cereza\r\nand Cheshire new skills.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_DIALOG_TXT_02": "Finish practising?",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_112_01": "Cereza can use her magic\r\nto stabilise Cheshire's unbound \r\ndemonic power and ride him\r\nin certain situations.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_249_02": "When feeling lost, try heading to\r\nareas marked with the white wolf's\r\nfootprint. There should be some \r\nwolf tracks nearby.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_104_02": "Elemental attacks can also have\r\nspecial effects, like removing\r\nenemy shields.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_215_02": "In Hug Mode, move Cereza with [BTN:LS ]\r\nand extend Cheshire with [BTN:RS ]\r\nto grab nearby objects.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_203_01": "In the status section of the menu,\r\nyou can check Cereza and Cheshire's\r\nstatus, as well as the items you\r\nhave in your possession.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_026_01": "When using this Witch Pulse,\r\nquickly tilt [BTN:LS ] twice\r\nwhere the two circles overlap.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_413": "Tap [BTN:L1 ] twice to call \r\nCheshire rocketing back to \r\nHug Mode, ploughing through \r\nall enemies in his path.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_108_03": "Stone Cheshire has a hard\r\nexterior capable of repelling\r\nmost attacks. Doing so, however,\r\ndrains his magic.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_102_01": "Cheshire can slash with his claws\r\nwith [BTN:R2 ]. This can also be used\r\nto clear away underbrush and break \r\npots and other objects.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_221_03": "Press [BTN:START ] inside a Tír na nÓg\r\nto open a menu that will let you\r\nexit and return to the forest.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_213_01": "Press [BTN:SELECT ] when learning skills\r\nto go to a practice room where\r\nyou can test your skills out.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_304": "Switch to Hug Mode in battle\r\nto gradually recover your magic.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_317": "Slows movement of enemies\r\ncaught in a Thorn Bind further.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_009_02": "Binding an enemy this way will\r\nconsume one Spell Cooldown gauge.\r\nSpell Cooldown will automatically \r\nrecover over time or by using items.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_113_01": "A skill that allows Cheshire \r\nto deflect attacks with [BTN:R1 ].\r\nDoing so drains his magic.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_105_02": "Cheshire recovers his magic\r\ngradually in Hug Mode.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_027_01": "Some flying enemies are extremely\r\nweak and can be defeated simply\r\nby using Thorn Bind on them.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_404": "Use [BTN:R3 ] to evade with Cheshire.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_417": "Perform a special Stone Elemental\r\nattack at the end of a Bind Combo\r\nwhen using Stone Cheshire.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_202_01": "In the map section of the menu,\r\nswitch between the world map\r\nand specific area maps with [BTN:Y ].",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_023_01": "A skill that increases the amount\r\nof items Cereza can hold.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_206_01": "Press [BTN:L1] near lanterns to\r\nvisit the Preparations menu,\r\nwhere you can save and more.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_210_02": "In order to concoct an item,\r\nyou will first have to find one\r\nto use for reference. Keep\r\nyour eyes peeled!",
  "MENU_CHALLENGE_TXT_12": "Select the Tír na nÓg \r\ntime trial you want to challenge.",
  "MENU_CHALLENGE_TXT_01": "Retry Tír na nÓg you have\r\npreviously completed.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_308": "While casting Thorn Bind \r\non an enemy their \r\nmovement will be slowed.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_228_02": "Some gates require a certain amount \r\nof wisps to open. Check if there \r\nare any wisps in the area you may \r\nnot have helped yet.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_117_01": "A skill that recovers magic \r\nwhen defeating enemies \r\nwith the Chomp! skill.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_217_01": "Press [BTN:L1 ] to switch to Hug \r\nMode, reverting Cheshire to his \r\nstuffed toy form.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_106_01": "Press [BTN:L1 ] near element sources\r\nto absorb them into Cereza's brace.\r\nAbsorbing enough will increase\r\nCheshire's magic gauge permanently.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_408": "Extend Cheshire with [BTN:RS ]\r\nin the direction of your movement\r\nto slightly increase your speed.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_110_02": "This attack can burn down\r\ncertain objects or melt ice.\r\nFire Cheshire is also able to\r\nwalk through flames undamaged.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_210_01": "In the Preparations menu, you \r\ncan use compounds to concoct \r\nitems. These items are used \r\non the field.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_318": "Bind an enemy after certain \r\nattacks to increase binding \r\ntime and damage.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_228_01": "Wisp Gates that you find\r\ncan be opened with the help\r\nof wisps.",
  "MENU_CHALLENGE_TXT_11": "Select the Tír na nÓg to retry.",
  "MENU_CHALLENGE_TXT_02": "Challenge different time trials.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_101_01": "Move Cheshire with [BTN:RS ].\r\nCheshire will automatically jump \r\nup/over small ledges and steps \r\nwhile moving.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_128_01": "A skill that allows Cheshire to change \r\nelements while continuing his combo.\r\nActivate by pressing [BTN:A ][BTN:B ][BTN:X ][BTN:Y ]\r\nduring an attack or dodge.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_217_02": "In Hug Mode, press [BTN:R1] to summon\r\nCheshire, switching to Unleashed Mode.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_201_01": "Use [BTN:START ] to open the menu. \r\nNavigate between the map,\r\narchive, status, and system tabs\r\nusing [BTN:L1 ][BTN:R1 ].",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_024_01": "A skill that increases the effects\r\nof all concoctions.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_110_01": "Press [BTN:A ] to transform to \r\nFire Cheshire. In this form, \r\nCheshire can use \r\na Pyro Blast with [BTN:R1 ].",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_418": "Finish off an enemy with Chomp\r\nto recover some magic.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_239_01": "Baked Geckos are a\r\nconcocting compound purified\r\nin bright yellow crystal. They \r\ncan be used for concoctions.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_510": "The max size of the cast area\r\nfor Thorn Bind increases.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_018_01": "A skill that slowly recovers magic\r\nwhen using Hug Mode in battle.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_114_01": "A skill that allows Cheshire \r\nto perform an additional attack \r\nby pressing [BTN:R2 ] after \r\nsuccessfully countering an enemy.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_403": "Hold and release [BTN:R2 ] to \r\nunleash a Charge Strike near \r\na weakened enemy to finish \r\nthem off.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_410": "Perform a special Wood Elemental\r\nattack at the end of a Bind Combo\r\nwhen using Wood Cheshire.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_205_01": "In the system section of the menu,\r\nyou can load another save, view\r\nTravel Wisdom, or change options.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_020_01": "A skill that allows Cereza to channel\r\nmagical energy into Cheshire,\r\nfilling his magic gauge in an instant\r\nby pressing [BTN:L1 ] while in Hug Mode.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_314": "Pick up Cheshire to create a \r\nsmall shockwave that stuns\r\nnearby enemies.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_226_03": "You can keep track of\r\nthe wisps you have helped\r\nin the \"Helped Wisps\" section \r\nof the Archive menu.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_105_01": "The gauge above Cheshire's head\r\nis his magic gauge. This decreases\r\nwhen using certain abilities.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_303": "Hold [BTN:L2 ] to call thorns that bind \r\nthe enemy. After casting you must \r\nwait for the Spell Cooldown gauge to \r\nrefill before you can cast it again.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_310": "Increases the capacity of \r\nthe Spell Cooldown gauge,\r\nallowing Cereza to use Thorn \r\nBind twice in quick succession.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_009_01": "Press and hold [BTN:L2 ] near\r\nan enemy to perform Thorn Bind,\r\ntemporarily immobilising them.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_248_01": "Your progress will be saved\r\nautomatically at lanterns, or other \r\nintervals across the story: look\r\nfor the bottom right icon.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_407": "Press [BTN:R2] while dodging\r\nto perform a dive attack.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_414": "Change elements with Cheshire \r\nwhile dodging or attacking \r\nto transform while continuing \r\nyour combo.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_202_02": "The fog covering sections of\r\nspecific areas can be cleared \r\nby meeting certain conditions.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_214_01": "Talk to Ignis to quickly\r\ntravel to any Sanctuaries\r\nCereza has visited previously.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_419": "Cheshire's attacks deal more\r\ndamage to enemies.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_225_01": "Search with [BTN:L1] to record\r\nremembrances of places\r\nparticularly memorable to\r\nCereza and Cheshire on their journey.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_241_01": "Pick one up to recover \r\nthe Spell Cooldown gauge,\r\nallowing Cereza to cast Umbran \r\nArts again more quickly.",
  "MENU_CHALLENGE_DIALOG_TXT_02": "Play this Tír na nÓg?",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_222_02": "Failing to meet the conditions\r\nof these missions will result\r\nin failing the Tír na nÓg.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_234_01": "Onyx Roses are flowers from\r\nthe depths of Inferno.\r\nCereza requires them\r\nto learn new skills.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_250_01": "Sometimes, like when faced with\r\nrosemary, or when Cheshire\r\nis far away, Cereza will be unable\r\nto call Cheshire back to Hug Mode.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_011_01": "A skill that increases the magic\r\nrecovered when successfully\r\nusing Thorn Bind on an enemy.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_125_01": "A skill where Cheshire can perform\r\na dive attack by pressing [BTN:R2]\r\nwhile evading.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_029_01": "Witch Pulse must be performed\r\nsuccessfully multiple times to work.\r\nBe sure to keep holding [BTN:L2 ]\r\nuntil it has completed.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_208_01": "Save from the Preparations \r\nmenu. Apart from auto-saves,\r\nit may be good to manually\r\nsave from time to time.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_121_01": "A skill that changes the last attack\r\nof a Bind Combo to a Stone\r\nElemental attack.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_406": "Unleash a Charge Strike after \r\nCereza has bound an enemy to\r\nperform a powerful combo attack.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_415": "Cheshire can withstand more damage\r\nbefore reverting to his stuffed form.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_230_01": "Stomp on large mushrooms with\r\nStone Cheshire to be bounced\r\nup to find otherwise \r\nunreachable areas.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_015_01": "Use Cereza's Restoration Magic by\r\nholding [BTN:L2 ] and rotating [BTN:LS ]\r\nnear a broken object to temporarily \r\nrestore it to its original condition. ",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_119_01": "A skill that performs a powerful, wide \r\nrange attack when pressing [BTN:R2 ] \r\nat the end of a Bind Combo.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_226_02": "Some wisps have requests. \r\nHelp them out and you might \r\nreceive something good.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_302": "Successfully use Thorn Bind\r\non an enemy to recover \r\na little magic.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_311": "Increases the rate you recover\r\nmagic while in Hug Mode.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_306": "Slightly increases the speed at \r\nwhich the Spell Cooldown \r\ngauge recovers.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_315": "Recover more magic from\r\na successful Thorn Bind.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_130_01": "A skill where Cheshire performs\r\na little jab that can distract enemies\r\nby pressing [BTN:R2 ] in Hug Mode.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_219_01": "Prints the white wolf has\r\nleft throughout the forest.\r\nApproach them to reveal\r\nmore of this path.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_402": "Hold [BTN:R2] to charge power, then\r\nrelease to have Cheshire perform a\r\npowerful pouncing attack.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_108_01": "Press [BTN:B] to transform \r\nto Stone Cheshire. In this form,\r\nCheshire can perform powerful\r\njump stomps with [BTN:R1 ].",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_411": "Use [BTN:R2 ] to follow up with \r\nan additional strike after \r\ncountering an enemy's attack.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_004_01": "The flower icons at the bottom left\r\nof the screen represent Cereza's\r\nvitality. Cereza's vitality will \r\ndecrease by enemy attacks.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_245_01": "Perfume in a crescent moon bottle.\r\nHold [BTN:DP_R ] to temporarily give\r\nCheshire unlimited magic energy\r\nto perform skills.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_221_01": "The illusions created by the faeries\r\noriginate in what is known as\r\na Tír na nÓg. These Tír na nÓg\r\nexist all throughout the forest.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_405": "Slightly increases Cheshire's vitality.\r\nCheshire reverts to his stuffed form\r\nwhen his vitality is depleted.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_416": "Perform a special Water Elemental\r\nattack at the end of a Bind Combo\r\nwhen using Water Cheshire.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_242_01": "A power-imbued crystal the shape \r\nof a crescent moon. Pick one up \r\nto restore some magic energy.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_226_01": "Wisps are trapped in all \r\nkinds of places. If you find\r\none, press [BTN:L1 ] to free it.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_003_01": "Press [BTN:L2 ] near a target, then \r\ntilt [BTN:LS ] with the right direction \r\nand timing in order to perform \r\nCereza's Witch Pulse.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_301": "While holding [BTN:L2 ], \r\ntilt [BTN:LS ] with the right timing\r\nto infuse magic into plants \r\nand other objects.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_312": "Hold more items.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_219_02": "The white wolf's prints will \r\nguide Cereza to her next objective.\r\nLook for them whenever lost.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_126_01": "A skill where Cheshire counters\r\nwhile transforming to Unleashed Mode. \r\nUse by pressing [BTN:R1 ] to summon Cheshire \r\nright before an enemy attack hits.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_004_02": "When Cereza's vitality reaches 0,\r\nit's game over. Be careful to \r\nkeep an eye on her remaining \r\nvitality!",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_221_02": "Destroy the core at the heart\r\nof the Tír na nÓg to remove\r\nthe illusions it creates.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_012_01": "A skill that increases the speed \r\nwith which the Spell Cooldown \r\ngauge recovers.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_237_01": "Mandragora Roots are a\r\nconcocting compound purified\r\nin bright green crystal. They \r\ncan be used for concoctions.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_401": "Press [BTN:R1 ] with Cheshire\r\nto deflect certain attacks.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_108_02": "These stomps can be used as an\r\nattack, or to smash, pop up, \r\nor flip over certain objects.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_016_01": "Press [BTN:L1 ] to evade an enemy\r\nattack at the last moment to \r\nactivate Witch Time, temporarily \r\nenabling extremely fast movement.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_233_01": "Avalon Drops are drippingly\r\nsweet crystallised pieces \r\nof magic. Cheshire requires \r\nthem to learn new skills.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_409": "Press [BTN:R2 ] at the end of\r\na Bind Combo to perform \r\na powerful wide range attack.",
  "MENU_CHALLENGE_DIALOG_TXT_01": "Spend items to unlock\r\nthis Tír na nÓg?",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_122_01": "A skill that changes the last attack\r\nof a Bind Combo to a Water\r\nElemental attack.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_250_02": "Check your surroundings and look\r\nfor a way to successfully reunite\r\nthe two.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_309": "Use [BTN:L3 ] to evade with Cereza.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_222_01": "Certain Tír na nÓg have missions\r\nwith special conditions that need\r\nto be fulfilled.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_246_01": "A potion in a thorn-laced bottle.\r\nHold [BTN:DP_D ] to create \r\na shockwave, stunning all \r\nnearby enemies.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_007_01": "In Hug Mode, toss Cheshire up \r\nto certain high areas by pressing \r\n[BTN:L1 ]. Sometimes you will\r\nneed to split up to proceed.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_133_01": "A skill that increases Cheshire's attack\r\npower. Affects all of Cheshire's\r\nattacks.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_232_01": "Cheshire can destroy Elemental Cores\r\nby attacking them. Destroy any\r\nwhen you find them to fulfil\r\nCereza's mission.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_332": "Increases the Spell Cooldown \r\ngauge to maximum capacity,\r\nallowing Cereza to use Thorn \r\nBind four times in quick succession.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_017_01": "A skill that allows Cereza\r\nto evade by pressing [BTN:L3 ].",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_425": "Enemies sometimes drop items\r\nwhen hit with Plush Punch.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_123_01": "A skill that changes the last attack\r\nof a Bind Combo to a Fire\r\nElemental attack.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_525": "The max size of the cast area\r\nfor Thorn Bind increases further.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_532": "The max size of the cast area\r\nfor Thorn Bind increases further still.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_010_02": "Enemies caught in Thorn Vice will\r\nbe bound longer and take more damage\r\nthan a regular Thorn Bind, helping\r\nCheshire to take them down quicker.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_006_01": "Press [BTN:L2 ] to use Cereza's \r\nUmbran Arts. If something can be \r\ntargeted nearby, Cereza will \r\nlock onto it automatically.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_247_01": "If ever lost, search for guiding\r\nlights drifting through the forest.\r\nThey will lead Cereza to a nearby\r\nSanctuary.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_223_01": "Some faeries use barriers in battle.\r\nNormal attacks will not work\r\non these barriers.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_421": "A skill that can summon Cheshire\r\nfrom Hug Mode with [BTN:R1 ] right \r\nbefore an enemy attack hits to have \r\nhim counterattack as he transforms.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_132_01": "A skill that increases Cheshire's vitality.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_325": "Further increases the capacity of \r\nthe Spell Cooldown gauge, allowing \r\nCereza to use Thorn Bind \r\nthree times in quick succession.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_209_02": "You can also challenge time trials\r\nfor certain Tír na nÓg. Complete \r\nthese trials to earn rewards based \r\non your performance.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_002_01": "Cereza is able to interact with\r\nvarious things by pressing [BTN:L1 ].",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_227_01": "After saving enough wisps,\r\nvisit Colm in the hideaway\r\nand he may give you a reward.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_243_01": "Umbran medicine in a bottle\r\nshaped like a petal.\r\nHold [BTN:DP_U ] to slightly \r\nrestore Cereza's vitality.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_127_01": "A skill that calls Cheshire \r\nrocketing back to Hug Mode, \r\nploughing through all enemies \r\nin his path by tapping [BTN:L1 ] twice. ",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_329": "Recover even more magic \r\nfrom a successful Thorn Bind.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_236_01": "Moon Pearls are pure \r\ncrystallised magic energy \r\nthat can be used to teach \r\nCereza especially powerful skills.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_109_02": "This Aquastream has a long \r\nrange and can push many objects,\r\nas well as extinguish flames.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_013_01": "A skill that slows the movement\r\nof all enemies while casting\r\nThorn Bind.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_209_01": "In the Preparations menu, you\r\ncan retry Tír na nÓg you have\r\ncompleted to collect treasure\r\nyou may have missed.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_120_01": "A skill that changes the last attack\r\nof a Bind Combo to a Wood\r\nElemental attack.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_014_01": "A skill that increases the capacity \r\nof the Spell Cooldown gauge,\r\nallowing Cereza to use Thorn Bind \r\nmultiple times in quick succession.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_112_03": "He can also use [BTN:A ][BTN:B ][BTN:X ][BTN:Y ] to\r\nperform powerful elemental attacks.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_231_01": "Press [BTN:L1 ] near element sources\r\nto absorb them into Cereza's brace.\r\nElemental power absorbed this\r\nway can only be done so once.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_118_01": "A skill that performs a powerful \r\nattack when using a Charge Strike \r\non a bound enemy with [BTN:R2 ]\r\nin Unleashed Mode.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_227_02": "When Colm has something to say,\r\na wisp mark will appear on the map.\r\nWhen you see it, be sure to drop\r\nby and chat with him.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_131_01": "A skill that causes enemies to drop\r\nitems when hit with Plush Punch.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_218_01": "In Hug Mode, grab foxtails with [BTN:RS ]\r\nand press [BTN:L1 ] to take a giant leap.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_109_01": "Press [BTN:X ] to transform \r\nto Water Cheshire. In this form,\r\nCheshire can shoot out a stream\r\nof water with [BTN:R1 ].",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_220_01": "In the distortions created by\r\nfaeries, many illusions stand\r\nin Cereza's way. Hold [BTN:L2 ] to\r\nshine a light to see hidden objects.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_244_01": "A potion in a butterfly bottle.\r\nHold [BTN:DP_L ] for temporary invincibility\r\nand increased speed for recasting\r\nUmbran Arts.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_005_01": "Collect five Vitality Petals or\r\na single Vitality Blossom\r\nto increase Cereza's total\r\nvitality.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_240_01": "Collect five Vitality Petals\r\nto create a Vitality Blossom,\r\nincreasing Cereza's vitality.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_224_01": "Pick up journals scattered throughout\r\nthe forest to add them to the Archive\r\nmenu so you can read them later.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_001_01": "Move Cereza with [BTN:LS ].\r\nCereza will automatically jump \r\nup/over small ledges and steps \r\nwhile moving.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_331": "Dodge an enemy's attack at the\r\nlast moment with [BTN:L1 ] to heighten \r\nyour perception and temporarily\r\nmove at extreme speeds.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_322": "Increases the effect of concoctions.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_135_01": "Press [BTN:R1 ] to make \r\nCheshire jump down ledges\r\nof a certain height. Look for\r\nledges with white markings.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_426": "Chances of an enemy dropping\r\nan item with Plush Punch increase;\r\nmore varieties of items also dropped.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_216_03": "If Cheshire is too far from\r\nCereza for too long, it'll be\r\ntrouble. Try to keep the two\r\nclose to each other.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_006_02": "Cereza's Spell Cooldown gauge\r\nis expended when using Umbran Arts,\r\nbut recovers by itself gradually.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_223_02": "To destroy the barriers, try using\r\nelemental attacks. Each type of\r\nbarrier is weak to a different\r\nelement.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_422": "Cheshire can withstand even more \r\ndamage before reverting to \r\nhis stuffed form.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_010_01": "Some enemies will be vulnerable\r\nafter certain attacks. Press and \r\nhold [BTN:L2 ] when this happens \r\nto perform Thorn Vice.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_235_01": "Inferno Fruits are special fruits\r\nthat can be used to teach\r\nCheshire especially powerful skills.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_124_01": "A skill that allows Cheshire\r\nto evade by pressing [BTN:R3]\r\nin Unleashed Mode.",
  "MENU_SKILLTREE_TXT_326": "Further increases the rate you \r\nrecover magic while in Hug Mode.",
  "MENU_HELP_TXT_028_01": "Press [BTN:L1 ] to make \r\nCereza jump down ledges\r\nof a certain height. Look for\r\nledges with white markings."
}
